// #66: a reset for a segment no connection takes: without ACK bit
// <SEQ=0><ACK=SEG.SEQ+SEG.LEN><CTL=RST,ACK>, with it <SEQ=SEG.ACK><CTL=RST>
// (RFC 9293 §3.10.7.1, tcp_v4_send_reset).
0      port 5555
+0     < P 1000:1100(100) win 4000
+0     > R. 0:0(0) ack 1100
+0     < P. 1000:1100(100) ack 5000 win 4000
+0     > R 5000:5000(0)
+0     < S 1000:1000(0) win 4000
+0     > R. 0:0(0) ack 1001
+0     < F 1000:1000(0) win 4000
+0     > R. 0:0(0) ack 1001
